<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on SMI index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on SMI index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued five million American-style put warrants on the SMI index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One SMI index is reprsented by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3900 CHF		  PREMIUM	-5.73 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.48 CHF		  GEARING	15.62 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	17.DEC.96</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100			 SPOT REF     3874 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
